Conjecture 168 is formalized and builds successfully. The formalization:

- **`erdos168_F N`** — defines F(N) as the maximum cardinality of a subset of {1,…,N} containing no triple {n, 2n, 3n}
- **`erdos_problem_168`** — states that the limit of F(N)/N exists and is irrational, matching the open conjecture
